---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Here's Your Copy of Starting the Conversation · The Geriatrician's Guide";
const description = "Download your copy of Starting the Conversation.";
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} noindex={true}>
  <div class="wrap section tk" data-screen-label="Starting the Conversation thank-you">

    <p class="eyebrow">All Set</p>
    <h1>Your guide is ready.</h1>
    <div class="tk__rule"></div>

    <p class="tk__body">Download <em>Starting the Conversation</em> below. A copy is also on its way to your inbox in case you want it later or need to print it again.</p>
    <p class="tk__body">Read it once straight through before your first conversation, then keep it close. The one thing worth doing first: write down your actual opening sentence, and make sure it leads with your worry rather than their failures.</p>

    <p class="tk__dl-label">The Guide</p>
    <p class="tk__dl-sub">Six steps to prepare, printable, with space to write your opening sentence before you say it out loud.</p>
    <a class="tk__dl" href="/downloads/starting-the-conversation.pdf" download="Starting the Conversation.pdf">
      <span class="tk__dl-num"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z"/><path d="M14 2v5h6"/><path d="M9 13h6"/><path d="M9 17h4"/></svg></span>
      <span>
        <span class="tk__dl-name">Starting the Conversation</span>
        <span class="tk__dl-meta">A six-step preparation framework for telling a loved one it may be time.</span>
      </span>
      <span class="tk__dl-action"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"/><path d="M7 10l5 5 5-5"/><path d="M12 15V3"/></svg> Download</span>
    </a>

    <div class="tk__spam">
      <p>Don&rsquo;t see the email in a few minutes? Check your spam or promotions folder for an email from <strong>dr.genualdi@geriatriciansguide.com</strong>, and add it to your contacts so the next one lands in your inbox.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="tk__next">
      <div class="tk__next-inner">
        <div class="tk__next-portrait">
          <img src="/images/author-genualdi.png" alt="Michael D. Genualdi, MD" width="928" height="1152">
        </div>
        <div class="tk__next-text">
          <p>The guide ends where the next decision begins. <em>The Tour Day Kit</em> is the 57 questions I would ask on a community tour &mdash; plus a pocket card to bring inside, a notes sheet for what you hear, and a scorecard to compare communities side by side.</p>
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/tour-kit">Get the free Tour Day Kit <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Dev note: this page is unlisted (noindex, no nav link, keep out of the sitemap);
         it's reachable only via the Kit redirect and the email. -->

  </div>
</BaseLayout>


<style>
  .tk { max-width: 800px; }
  .tk .eyebrow { font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; }
  .tk h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif); font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(38px, 6.5vw, 56px); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--ink); margin-top: 14px;
  }
  .tk__rule { width: 96px; height: var(--rule-terra); background: var(--terra); margin: 26px 0 0; }
  .tk__lede p {
    font-family: var(--font-serif); font-style: italic; font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(19px, 2.4vw, 22px); line-height: 1.55; color: var(--ink);
    margin-top: 28px; text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .tk__body { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 400; font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 18px; text-wrap: pretty; }
  .tk__body b { font-weight: 600; }
  .tk__dl-label { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.16em; font-size: 13px; color: var(--terra); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin: 48px 0 8px; }
  .tk__dl-label::after { content: ""; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--hairline); }
  .tk__dl-sub { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 400; font-size: 17px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.8; text-wrap: pretty; margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .tk__dl { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr auto; gap: 20px; align-items: center; background: var(--terra-tint); border: 1px solid var(--hairline); border-left: 3px solid var(--terra); outline: 1.5px solid transparent; outline-offset: -2px; border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0; padding: 20px 24px; text-decoration: none; transition: outline-color .15s ease, box-shadow .15s ease; }
  .tk__dl:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-card); outline-color: var(--terra); text-decoration: none; }
  .tk__dl-num { width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: var(--terra); color: var(--paper); }
  .tk__dl-num svg { display: block; }
  .tk__dl-name { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-weight: 500; font-size: 19px; color: var(--ink); display: block; }
  .tk__dl-meta { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.5; display: block; }
  .tk__dl-action { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.02em; color: var(--ink); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--terra); padding-bottom: 3px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .tk__dl-action svg { display: block; color: var(--terra); }
  .tk__spam { background: var(--midnight-tint); border-left: 2px solid var(--faint); border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0; padding: 18px 22px; margin-top: 32px; }
  .tk__spam p { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 400; font-size: 15px; color: var(--ink); line-height: 1.7; margin: 0; }
  .tk__next { margin-top: 44px; padding-top: 28px; border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline); display: grid; grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr; gap: 26px; align-items: start; }
  .tk__next-portrait img { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: var(--radius); display: block; }
  .tk__next-text p { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-weight: 400; font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 20px; text-wrap: pretty; }
  @media (max-width: 500px) {
    .tk__next { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .tk__next-portrait { width: 90px; }
  }
  .tk-kit-placeholder {
    border: 1px dashed var(--hairline); border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--midnight-tint);
    padding: 14px 18px; margin-top: 20px;
    font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .tk__dl { grid-template-columns: 44px 1fr; }
    .tk__dl-action { grid-column: 2; }
  }
</style>
